      "id": "concept_6",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Sometimes the question itself defines a notation, such as [p] meaning the greatest integer not exceeding p.\n\nTreat that definition like a custom operator. The safest habit is: read definition → apply it to each input → then simplify.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
